# There is no build step: this repository is the deploy folder, and
# `vercel deploy` ships it byte for byte. Every page is CRLF throughout.
#
# Without this, a clone with core.autocrlf=true stores the pages
# LF-normalised - index.html is 119137 bytes as deployed and lands in the
# object store as 118192, exactly 945 bytes short, one per line. The clone
# then holds files that are not what is live, and any byte-comparison against
# the live site reports a mismatch that is not real.
#
# No end-of-line conversion, in either direction. What is committed is what ships.
* -text
